<span class="eyebrow">Software review</span><h1>Notion Review: Features, Limits and Fit</h1><p><?=e($pageDescription)?></p>
<div class="article-meta"><span><strong>Written by <a href="/about-deepak-parmar/">Deepak Parmar</a></strong></span><span>Published <time datetime="2026-11-08">November 8, 2026</time></span><span>Last updated <time datetime="2026-11-08">November 8, 2026</time></span></div>
